The values is a list of 7, 13, 11, 10, and 1.
The nexts is a list of 1, 2, 3, 4, and -1.
The randoms is a list of -1, 0, 4, 2, and 0.
The copyvalues is an empty list of whole numbers.
The copynexts is an empty list of whole numbers.
The copyrandoms is an empty list of whole numbers.
For each value in values.
Place value into copyvalues.

For each next in nexts.
Place next into copynexts.

For each random in randoms.
Place random into copyrandoms.

For every node from 0 to 4.
The line is format whole number item node of copyvalues as text.
Place " " into line.
The random is item node of copyrandoms.
If random is at least 0, Place format whole number item random of copyvalues as text into line, otherwise Place "-1" into line.
Show line.
